  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat and saute the onion until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the curry powder and cook for 1 minute until the spices are fragrant.",
    "Add the fish stock and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and add the confit tomato, cod fish, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Simmer the curry for 10 minutes until the fish is cooked through.",
    "Stir in the coconut milk and cook for an additional 2 minutes until the curry is heated through.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the curry hot over rice or with naan bread."
